stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Empty
    Empty --> Loading: submit valid city (>=2 chars)
    Loading --> Loading: new search submitted (cancel/ignore stale)
    Loading --> Success: geocode + forecast OK
    Loading --> NotFound: geocode returns no results
    Loading --> NetworkError: fetch/HTTP failure
    NotFound --> Loading: user searches again
    NetworkError --> Loading: user searches again
    Success --> Loading: user searches another city
    Success --> Success: show current + 7-day forecast
